#. 葉隠クン、
#. トイレなんかで何してるの？
msgctxt "0001 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "What are you doing in the bathroom, Hiro?"
msgstr ""

#. あぁ？　それはな…
msgctxt "0002 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid "Huh? Oh, well..."
msgstr ""

#. 俺の占いによると…
msgctxt "0003 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid "I consulted the spirits, and..."
msgstr ""

#. 朝食会に出られないほどの緊急事態…！
#. すなわち…
msgctxt "0004 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid ""
"He had a bathroom emergency and couldn't make it to\n"
"breakfast!"
msgstr ""

#. 腹壊して、ここにこもってると出た！
msgctxt "0005 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid "His guts forced him to spend all morning in the can!"
msgstr ""

#. んだべが…空振りしたべ…
#. 三者凡退だべ…
msgctxt "0006 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid ""
"But I was totally wrong, swing and a miss, three\n"
"strikes I'm out..."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>十神クンは、そういうタイプじゃないよな…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0007 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Yeah, Byakuya doesn't seem like the kind of guy to\n"
"have problems like that...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. しゃーないべ、もっかい占って
#. とっとと見つけるべ！
msgctxt "0008 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid ""
"Well, what're ya gonna do? Time to consult the spirits\n"
"again and track him down!"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>水槽だ…
#. 小さな魚が泳いでいる…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0009 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>It's a fish tank. There's a bunch of little fish\n"
"swimming around inside...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. はい
msgctxt "0010 | CHOICE/RE:ACT"
msgid "Yes"
msgstr ""

#. いいえ
msgctxt "0011 | CHOICE/RE:ACT"
msgid "No"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 23>外に出ますか？
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0012 | NARRATION"
msgid ""
"<CLT 23>Leave the area?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""
